The AMF selection functionality in the 5G-AN may consider the following factors for selecting the AMF Set: 
- 
AMF Region ID and AMF Set ID derived from GUAMI; 
- 
Requested NSSAI; 
- 
Local operator policies; 
- 
5G CIoT features indicated in RRC signalling by the UE; 
- 
IAB-indication; 
- 
NB-IoT RAT Type; 
- 
Category M Indication;

NOTE 3: The NEF discovery and selection procedures described in this clause are intended to be applied by NF 
consumers deployed within the operator's domain. 
NOTE 4: The NEF supporting the capabilities can be configured in the AF or discovered by AF with the assistance 
of NRF. 
